 "description": "IRREVERSIBLE SIDE EFFECT: forwards the envelope to POST https://x402-agent-pay.com/facilitator/settle. The existing facilitator first re-runs verify(), then refuses PAYEE_NOT_SERVED_HERE unless payTo is the AgentPay treasury (0x367F1b3D8Ca90D1e087481a9A40d585Bf3451a03 on Base / 6aCEuwH3PYx99cEmRz45otfxk39uF7ewGhqmvxfXisSG on Solana), then broadcasts via Coinbase CDP and returns a transaction hash. Malformed, unsigned, out-of-scope, or unverified payloads are rejected before any external transfer. This adapter never signs, never holds keys, and never bypasses those gates. Do not call this as a dry run.",
